# Email Configuration for OTP Service
# Gmail Setup Instructions:
# 1. Enable 2-Factor Authentication on your Google Account: https://myaccount.google.com/security
# 2. Generate an App Password: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Select "Mail" and "Windows Computer" (or your device)
# 4. Google will generate a 16-character password (save it without spaces)
# 5. Copy the password below (WITHOUT any spaces)

MAIL_USERNAME=your-email@gmail.com
MAIL_PASSWORD=your-16-char-app-password-no-spaces
